msgid ""
"The Activity for an investment transaction describes what action is "
"happening to the security. The following activities are supported:"
msgstr ""
"Aktivnost investicijske transakcije opisuje koja akcija se izvršava nad "
"dionicom. Sljedeće aktivnosti su podržane:"

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "Buy/Sell"
msgstr "Kupi/Prodaj"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:344
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Use to record purchases or sales of individual investments. This action "
#| "requires an account to transfer the funds from/to."
msgid ""
"Use to record purchases or sales of individual securities. This action "
"requires an account to transfer the funds from/to, which defaults to the "
"Brokerage account, if one has been created."
msgstr ""
"Koriste se radi snimanja kupovine ili prodaje individualnih investicija. Ova "
"akcija zahtijeva račun za transfer novčanih sredstava."

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dividend/Yield"
msgstr "Dividenda/Prinos"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:355
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Also known as a <quote>Cash Dividend</quote>, this action is used for "
#| "when you receive an interest or dividend disbursement from your "
#| "investment. This action requires an account to transfer the funds from/to."
msgid ""
"Also known as a <quote>Cash Dividend</quote>, this action is used when you "
"receive an interest or dividend disbursement from your security. This action "
"also requires an account to transfer the funds to."
msgstr ""
"Također poznato kao <quote>Gotovinska dividenda</quote>, ova akcija se "
"koristi kada dobijete interes ili isplatu dividende od svoje investicije. "
"Ova akcija zahtijeva račun za transfer novčanih sredstava."

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reinvest Dividend"
msgstr "Dividenda reinvesticije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:366
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Reinvest Dividend. This is a dividend where the proceeds are re-invested "
#| "back into the investment."
msgid ""
"Reinvest Dividend. This is a dividend where the proceeds are used to "
"purchase additional shares of the security."
msgstr ""
"Dividenda reinvesticije. Ovo je dividenda u kojoj se prihodi ponoco "
"investiraju u investiciju."

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add/Remove Shares"
msgstr "Dodaj/Ukloni akcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A simple increase or decrease in the number of shares you own. This should "
"be used very rarely, because it's uncommon for shares to just show up in "
"your account (or disappear) unless it's a purchase or a sale. One use of "
"these activities is for some situations &kmymoney; does not natively handle, "
"such as the exchange of some number of shares of a security for a different "
"number of shares of a different class of the same security."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid "Split Shares"
msgstr "Podjieljene akcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:390
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Used when the stock is split. Enter the ratio of the split in the "
#| "<quote>Split Ratio</quote> field. For example, in a 3:2 split, enter 1.5"
msgid ""
"This is used when the stock is split. Enter the ratio of the split in the "
"<quote>Split Ratio</quote> field. For example, in a 3:2 split, enter 1.5. "
"Reverse splits, where the ration is less than one, such as 2:3, although "
"uncommon, are also allowed."
msgstr ""
"Koriste se kada je akcija podijeljena. Unosite odnos podjele u <quote>Split "
"Ratio</quote> polje. Npr., u 3:2 podjeli, unesite 1.5"

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Security</title>"
msgstr "<title>Sigurnost</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:403
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Each investment transaction must be associated with an individual "
#| "security, which is here just another name for an investment. Choose the "
#| "investment name when adding or editing a transaction. The symbol will be "
#| "displayed when viewing it."
msgid ""
"Each investment transaction must be associated with an individual security. "
"Choose the security name when adding or editing a transaction. The symbol "
"will be displayed when viewing it."
msgstr ""
"Svaka investiciona transakcija mora biti povezana sa individualnom "
"sigurnošću, koja je ovdje samo još jedno ime za investiciju. Odaberite ime "
"investicije prilikom dodavanja ili editovanja transakcije. Simbol će se "
"prikazati prilikom pregledanja istog."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Account</title>"
msgstr "<title>Račun</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:412
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "For any transactions which generate or require money, you must enter the "
#| "account where the money is transferred to/from. If your investment "
#| "account has an associated brokerage account, it's usually best to "
#| "transfer the funds there. This applies to funds for purchase or sale of "
#| "the investment, as well as for fees paid or interest or dividends earned."
msgid ""
"For any transaction which generates or requires money, you must enter the "
"account where the money is transferred to/from. If your investment account "
"has an associated Brokerage account, it is usually best to transfer the "
"funds there. This applies to funds for purchase or sale of the security, as "
"well as for fees paid or interest or dividends earned."
msgstr ""
"Za sve transakcije koje generišu ili zahtijevaju novac, morate unijeti račun "
"na/sa kojeg se novac prenosi. Ukoliko vaš investicioni račun ima povezan "
"brokerski račun, često je bolje da novčana sredstva prebacite na/sa njega. "
"Ovo se odnosi na novčana sredstva za prodaju ili kupovinu investicije kao i "
"za naknade plaćene za kamate ili zarađene dividende."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shares, Price &amp; Total Amount"
msgstr "Akcije, cijena &amp; ukupni iznos"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:423
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "For buy, sell, and cash dividend transactions, the number of shares, the "
#| "price per share, and the total amount of the transaction must be "
#| "established. You can enter any two of these, and &kappname; will "
#| "calculate the third. It's usually best to enter just the total amount and "
#| "the number of shares, because these are the known facts of the "
#| "transaction. The price per share can be calculated from these."
msgid ""
"For buy, sell, and reinvestment transactions, the number of shares, the "
"price per share, and the total amount of the transaction must be "
"established. You can enter any two of these, and &kmymoney; will calculate "
"the third. It's usually best to enter just the total amount and the number "
"of shares, because these are the known facts of the transaction. &kmymoney; "
"will automatically calculate the price per share. Note that there is only "
"one entry field for the price, and it will be labeled <quote>Transaction "
"amount</quote> or <quote>Price/share</quote> depending on the setting of the "
"<guilabel>Price entry</guilabel> option when the account was <link linkend="
"\"details.investments.newinvestmentwizard\">set up</link>."
msgstr ""
"Za prodaju, kupovinu i transakciju dividendi, broj akcija, cijene po akciji "
"i ukupnan iznos transakcije mora biti unesen. Možete unijeti bilo koje dvoje "
"od navedenih i &kappname; če izračunati treće. Često je najbolje da unesete "
"ukupni iznos i broj dionica, pošto su to poznate informacije transakcije. "
"Cijena po akciji će se izračunati iz ovih."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:438
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Fees</title>"
msgstr "<title>Naknade</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:439
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With many investment transactions you can include the fees (or commission) "
"you paid the broker. If you enter a category for the fee, then a field will "
"be shown to the right where you can enter the amount of the fee. If you need "
"to enter more than one fee for the transaction, you can use the <link "
"linkend=\"details.ledgers.split\">Split Transactions</link> feature. In this "
"case, when you complete entering all the splits, the total amount of the "
"fees will be shown to the right."
msgstr ""
"Sa puno investicionih transakcija možete uključiti naknade koje ste platili "
"brokeru. Ukoliko unesete kategoriju za naknadu, onda će se pojaviti polje na "
"desnoj strani gdje možete unijeti iznos naknade. Ukoliko morate unijeti više "
"od jedne naknade za transakciju, možete upotrijebiti <link linkend=\"details."
"ledgers.split\">Split Transactions</link> opciju. U ovom slučaju, kada "
"završite sa unosom svih dijelova, ukupni iznos naknada će ce prikazati na "
"desnoj strani."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interest"
msgstr "Kamata"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:452
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This is how you enter an interest or dividend payment from an investment. "
#| "As with fees, if you enter a category, then a field will be shown to the "
#| "right where you can enter the amount. You can also use the split "
#| "transaction feature, if required."
msgid ""
"This is how you enter an interest or dividend payment from a security. As "
"with fees, if you enter a category, then a field will be shown to the right "
"where you can enter the amount. You can also use the split transaction "
"feature, if required."
msgstr ""
"Ovako unosite kamatu ili dividendnu isplatu iz investicije. Kao i sa "
"naknadama, ukoliko unesete kategoriju, desno će se pojaviti polje da se "
"unese iznos. Također možete koristitiopciju podjele transakcije, ukoliko je "
"potrebno."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working With Foreign Investments"
msgstr "Rad sa stranim investicijama"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:464
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; supports multiple currencies and investments, and you may want "
#| "to combine the two. However, doing so requires extra care. As noted "
#| "above, when you added an investment, you had to specify its trading "
#| "currency. This might not be the same as your base currency, and it also "
#| "might not be the same as the account in which you hold the stock or the "
#| "account where you transfer your funds to/from for buys/sells."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; supports multiple currencies and securities, and you may want to "
"combine the two. However, doing so requires extra care to assure accurate "
"records. As noted above, when you add a security, you must specify its "
"trading currency. This might not be the same as the base currency for your "
"&kmymoney; file, and it also might not be the same as the default currency "
"for the investment account in which you hold the stock or the account where "
"you transfer your funds to/from for buys/sells."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; podržava više valuta i investicija, i možda zaželite "
"iskombinovati to dvoje. Ipak, potrebna pažnja je potrebna za to. Kao što je "
"navedeno iznad, kada dodate investiciju, morate navesti njenu valutu za "
"trgovanje. Ovo možda neće biti isto kao i vaša bazna valuta i možda neće "
"biti ista kao ona u računu u kojem držite svoje akcije ili u računu u kojem "
"vršite transfere novčanih sredstava za kupovinu/prodaju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:474
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Consider a hypothetical case. Your base currency is USD. You have an "
#| "investment account in EUR, and a brokerage account also in EUR. In that "
#| "account, you hold shares of TietoEnator, which is traded in SEK."
msgid ""
"Consider a hypothetical case, where your base currency is USD. You have an "
"investment account in EUR, and a brokerage account also in EUR. In that "
"investment account, you hold shares of TietoEnator, which is traded in SEK."
msgstr ""
"Uzmite u obzir hipotetički slučaj. Vaša bazna valuta je američki dolar. "
"Imate investicijski račun u eurima i brokerski račun također u eurima. U tom "
"računu držite akcije TietoEnatora kojima se trguje u SEK."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:480
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When you enter a buy transaction on this investment, use SEK as the "
#| "currency. So if you buy 100 shares at a price of SEK 248.00, for a total "
#| "of SEK 24,800.00, enter these values in the transaction."
msgid ""
"When you enter a buy transaction for this investment, use SEK as the "
"currency. So if you buy 100 shares at a price of SEK 248.00, for a total of "
"SEK 24,800.00, enter these values in the transaction."
msgstr ""
"Kada unesete transakciju kupovanja za ovu investiciju, upotrijebite SEk kao "
"valutu, Tako ako kupite 100 akcija po cijeni SEK 248.00, ukupno za SEK "
"24,800.00, unesite ove vrijednosti u transakciju."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-investments.docbook:488
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Currency Warning</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Currency Warning</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-investments.docbook:494
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Currency Warning</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Upozorenje za valutu</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:500
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you choose the brokerage account to fund the transfer, you'll be warned "
"that it's in a different currency."
msgstr ""
"Kada odaberete brokerski račun za transfer novčanih sredstava, bićete "
"upozoreni da je njegova valuta drugačija."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-investments.docbook:507
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Exchange Rate Editor</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Uređivač kursa</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-investments.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Exchange Rate Editor</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Editor kursa</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:519
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When you finish the transaction, you will be prompted for a price update "
#| "to the investment account's currency, in this case, SEK -> EUR. Review "
#| "the documentation on <link linkend=\"details.currencies.prices\">Entering "
#| "Prices Manually</link> for more information on the price dialog."
msgid ""
"When you finish entering the transaction, you will be prompted for a price "
"update to the investment account's currency, in this case, SEK -> EUR. "
"Review the documentation on <link linkend=\"details.currencies.prices"
"\">Entering Prices Manually</link> for more information on the price dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kada završite transakciju, bićete upitani za ažuriranje cijene za valutu "
"investicionog računa, u ovom slučaju, SEK -> EUR. Pregledajte dokumentaciju "
"na <link linkend=\"details.currencies.prices\">Entering Prices Manually</"
"link> za više informacija o dijalogu cijene."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:526
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you then switch over to the brokerage account, you will see the "
#| "transaction as EUR 2,254.54, assuming an exchange rate is 11.0000 SEK / "
#| "EUR."
msgid ""
"If you then switch over to the brokerage account, you will see the "
"transaction as EUR 2,254.54, assuming an exchange rate is 11.0000 SEK/EUR."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko se potom prebacite na brokerski račun, vidjećete transakciju kao EUR "
"2,254.54, pretpostavljajući da je kurs 11.0000 SEK / EUR."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:533
#, no-c-format
msgid "Updating Prices"
msgstr "Ažuriranje cijena"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:535
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "There are two ways of updating the prices for your investments. You can "
#| "either enter the new price manually or have &kappname; fetch it from the "
#| "web."
msgid ""
"There are two ways of updating the prices for your investments. You can "
"either enter the price manually or have &kmymoney; fetch it from the web."
msgstr ""
"Postoje dva načina za ažuriranje cijena za vašu investiciju. Možete ili "
"unijeti cijenu ručno ili je može &kappname; dobaviti sa interneta."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:541
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manual Price Updates"
msgstr "Ručna ažuriranja cijena"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can enter prices for your investments using the same <link linkend="
"\"details.currencies.prices\">Price Editor</link> as used for currencies."
msgstr ""
"Možete unijeti cijene za svoje investicije upotrebom istog <link linkend="
"\"details.currencies.prices\">Price Editor</link> kao i za valute."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:551
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online Price Quotes"
msgstr "Online navodi cijena"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:552
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; has the ability to download the latest prices for your "
#| "investments and currencies via the web."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; has the ability to download the latest prices for your securities "
"and currencies via the web."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; ima mogućnost da downloaduje najnovije cijene za vaše investicije "
"i valute pomoću interneta."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:558
#, no-c-format
msgid "How Online Quotes Work"
msgstr "Kako online navodi rade"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:559
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "At your request, &kappname; will fetch a page from the web that contains "
#| "the latest price for each item. By default, prices are fetched from "
#| "<ulink url=\"http://finance.yahoo.com\">finance.yahoo.com</ulink>, and "
#| "are subject to the terms and conditions of that site."
msgid ""
"At your request, &kmymoney; will fetch a page from the web that contains the "
"latest price for each security. By default, prices are fetched from <ulink "
"url=\"https://finance.yahoo.com\">finance.yahoo.com</ulink>, and are subject "
"to the terms and conditions of that site."
msgstr ""
"Po vašem zahtjevu, &kappname; če dobaviti stranicu sa interneta koja sadrži "
"najnovije cijene za svaku stavku. Kao što je unaprijed definisano, cijene se "
"dobavljaju sa <ulink url=\"http://finance.yahoo.com\">finance.yahoo.com</"
"ulink> i u skladu su sa uvjetima te stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:566
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The online quote lookup uses the investment's trading symbol to find the "
#| "price. Therefore, it's important to set the symbol correctly. Yahoo "
#| "supports stocks from most major world markets, so it's usually just a "
#| "matter of finding the correct symbol. For example, TietoEnator trades on "
#| "the Stockholm Stock Exchange market, and its Yahoo symbol is TIEN.ST."
msgid ""
"The online quote lookup uses the security's trading symbol to find the "
"price. Therefore, it is important to set the symbol correctly. Yahoo "
"supports stocks from most major world markets, so it's usually just a matter "
"of finding the correct symbol. For example, TietoEnator trades on the "
"Stockholm Stock Exchange market, and its Yahoo symbol is TIEN.ST."
msgstr ""
"Pretraživač online navoda koristi simbol trgovanja investicije da bi "
"pronašao cijene. Zato je potrebno da se simbol postavi korektno. Yahoo "
"podržava dionice sa većine glavnih svjetskih tržišta, pa je često samo "
"pitanje pronalaska pravog simbola. Npr., TietoEnator trguje na Stockholm "
"Stock Exchange tržištu i njegov Yahoo simbol je TIEN.ST."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:574
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To find the trading symbol for a security supported by Yahoo, use the "
#| "<quote>Symbol Lookup</quote> feature at <ulink url=\"http://finance.yahoo."
#| "com\">finance.yahoo.com</ulink>."
msgid ""
"To find the trading symbol for a security supported by Yahoo, use the "
"<quote>Symbol Lookup</quote> feature at <ulink url=\"https://finance.yahoo."
"com\">finance.yahoo.com</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste pronašli simbol pomoću kojeg se trguje podržan od Yahoo-a, "
"koristite <quote>Symbol Lookup</quote> opciju na <ulink url=\"http://finance."
"yahoo.com\">finance.yahoo.com</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:582
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigning a Quote Source"
msgstr "Dodjela izvora navoda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:584
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In order to get online price quotes, you first have to enable it for each "
#| "investment or currency you want updated, by setting a <quote>Online Quote "
#| "Source</quote>. This is the name of the service from which the quote "
#| "should be fetched. &kappname; ships with several sources to choose from. "
#| "Yahoo is the recommended default source, and should work for most "
#| "investments and all currencies."
msgid ""
"In order to get online price quotes, you first have to enable it for each "
"security or currency you want updated, by setting a <quote>Online Quote "
"Source</quote>. This is the name of the service from which the quote should "
"be fetched. &kmymoney; ships with several sources to choose from. Yahoo is "
"the recommended default source, and should work for most investments and all "
"currencies."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dobili navode online cijena, prvo to morate omogućiti za svaku "
"investiciju ili valutu za koju želite ažuriranje, pomoću postavljanja "
"<quote>Online Quote Source</quote>. Ovo je ime servisa sa kojeg bi se navod "
"trebao dobaviti. &kappname; vam donosi nekoliko izbora između kojih možete "
"birati. Yahoo je preporučeni unaprijed definisani izvor i trebao bi raditi "
"za većinu investicija i za sve valute."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:593
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To assign a quote source to an investment, navigate to the investment "
#| "summary view for the account in which the security is held. Edit the "
#| "security by right-clicking it and selecting <guimenuitem>Edit "
#| "Investment ...</guimenuitem>. In the Investment Detail Wizard, click "
#| "<guibutton>Next</guibutton> twice, for the Online Update section. In the "
#| "Online source dropdown box, select the online source."
msgid ""
"To assign a quote source for an investment, navigate to the investment "
"summary view for the account in which the security is held. Edit the "
"security by right-clicking it and selecting <guimenuitem>Edit Investment ..."
"</guimenuitem>. In the Investment Detail Wizard, click <guibutton>Next</"
"guibutton> twice, for the Online Update section. In the Online source "
"dropdown box, select the online source for your needs."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dodijelili izvor navoda investiciji, otiđite na sumarni pregled "
"investicija za račun u kojem se nalazi sigurnost. Editujte sigurnost desnim "
"klikom na nju i odabirom <guimenuitem>Edit Investment ...</guimenuitem>. U "
"čarobnjaku detalja investicije, kliknite na <guibutton>Next</guibutton> dva "
"puta, za sekciju online ažuriranja. U opadajućem prostori online izvora, "
"odaberite jedan online izvor."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:602
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Versions of &kappname; starting with 0.9 contain support for the Finance::"
#| "Quote package for obtaining online quotes. This is intended primarily as "
#| "a convenience for those users converting from the GnuCash finance "
#| "package, which uses it as its native method. If you do select this "
#| "option, you should see a different list of sources, those supported by "
#| "Finance::Quote. If the list is empty, it suggests that the package is not "
#| "properly installed. See their web site at <ulink url=\"http://finance-"
#| "quote.sourceforge.net\"> http://finance-quote.sourceforge.net</ulink> for "
#| "more information."
msgid ""
"Versions of &kmymoney; starting with 0.9 contain support for the Finance::"
"Quote package for obtaining online quotes. This is intended primarily as a "
"convenience for those users converting from the &gnucash; finance package, "
"which uses it as its native method. If you do select this option, you should "
"see a different list of sources, those supported by Finance::Quote. If the "
"list is empty, it suggests that the package is not properly installed. See "
"their web site at <ulink url=\"http://finance-quote.sourceforge.net\"> "
"http://finance-quote.sourceforge.net</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Verzije &kappname; počevši od 0.9 sadrže podršku za Finansije::Navod paket "
"za dobivanje online navoda. Ovo je primarno namijenjeno kao pogodnost za one "
"korisnike koji konvertuju iz GnuCash finansijskog paketa koji ovo koristi "
"kao urođenu metodu. Ukoliko odaberete ovu opciju, treali biste vidjeti "
"različitu listu izvora, one podržane od strane Finansija::Navod. Ukoliko je "
"lista prazna, vjerovatno paket nije pravilno instaliran. Pogledajte njihovu "
"internet stranicu na <ulink url=\"http://finance-quote.sourceforge.net\"> "
"http://finance-quote.sourceforge.net</ulink> za više informacija."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:615
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adjusting a quote"
msgstr "Podešavanje navoda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some online sources do not report the price in a base quantity (&eg;, EUR) "
"but in a fraction (&eg;, Cent). Using this information as price will produce "
"wrong values for your investments."
msgstr ""
"Neki online izvori ne prijavljuju cijenu u baznoj količini (&eg;, EUR) već u "
"frakciji (&eg;, Cent). Upotreba ove informacije kao cijene će proizvesti "
"pogrešne vrijednosti za vaše investicije."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:623
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is the case for your online source, you can use the "
"<guilabel>Factor</guilabel> field to enter an adjusting factor. For the "
"above mentioned example the factor would be 0.01."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko je ovo slulčaj sa vašim online izvorom, možete upotrijebiti "
"<guilabel>Factor</guilabel> polje da unesete podešavajući faktor. Za gore "
"navedeni primjer, on bi bio 0.01."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:629
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Factor</guilabel> field is only available if a "
"<guibutton>Quote Source</guibutton> has been selected."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Faktor</guilabel> polje je omogućeno samo ako je <guibutton>Izvor "
"navoda</guibutton> selektirano."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:636
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fetching Quotes"
msgstr "Dobavljanje navoda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:638
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Typically, you will update the prices for all your investments and "
#| "currencies at once. Choose the <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
#| "guimenu><guimenuitem>Update Stock and Currency Prices...</guimenuitem></"
#| "menuchoice> menu option to bring up the online price quotes dialog. Press "
#| "<guibutton>Update All</guibutton> to fetch quotes for all investments and "
#| "currencies in your &kappname; file."
msgid ""
"Typically, you will update the prices for all your securities and currencies "
"as a single operation. Choose the <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Update Stock and Currency Prices...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> menu item to bring up the online price quotes dialog. Press "
"<guibutton>Update All</guibutton> to fetch quotes for all securities and "
"currencies in your &kmymoney; file."
msgstr ""
"Najčešće ćete ažurirati cijene za sve svoje investicije i valute odjednom. "
"Odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Alati</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ažuriraj cijene "
"dionica i valuta...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> opciju menija da bi se "
"prikazao dijalog za online navode cijena. Pritisnite <guibutton>Ažuriraj "
"sve</guibutton> kako biste dobili navode za sve investicije i valute u "
"svojoj &kappname; datoteci."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-investments.docbook:649
#, no-c-format
msgid "Update Stock and Currency Prices"
msgstr "Ažuriraj cijene dionica i valuta"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-investments.docbook:655
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online Stock and Currency Price Update"
msgstr "Online ažuriranje cijena dionica i valuta"

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:663
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding or Editing Quote Sources"
msgstr "Dodavanje ili editovanje izvora navoda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:665
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Adding or editing quote sources is not recommended for anyone but the "
#| "most technical user. You should feel comfortable reading HTML and writing "
#| "complex regular expressions. If this doesn't sound like you, we recommend "
#| "writing to the developer's list if none of the quote sources work for "
#| "you. Ideally, please point us to a web page where these quotes can be "
#| "obtained."
msgid ""
"Adding or editing quote sources is not recommended for anyone but the most "
"technical user. You should feel comfortable reading HTML and writing complex "
"regular expressions. If this doesn't sound like you, we recommend writing to "
"the developer's list if none of the quote sources work for you. Ideally, "
"please point us to a web page where these quotes can be obtained. "
"Additionally you can consult with members of the KDE Community Forum for "
"&kmymoney; as they may already have a solution available for your needs."
msgstr ""
"Dodavanje ili editovanje izvora navoda nije preporučeno za bilo koga osim za "
"tehničke korisnike. Trebate se osjećati ugodno čitajući HTML i pišući "
"kompleksne regularne izraze. Ukoliko vas ovo ne opisuje, preporučujemo da se "
"obratite listi developera ukoliko vam nijedan od izvora navoda ne odgovara. "
"Idealno, molimo vas da nas uputite na stranicu sa koje se ovi navodi mogu "
"dobiti."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:675
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you do feel up to the challenge, here's how it works. The quote "
#| "sources are contained in the settings dialog. Choose "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;</"
#| "guimenuitem></menuchoice>. From there, choose the <guilabel>Online "
#| "Quotes</guilabel> section. You can choose an existing source to edit, or "
#| "create a new one. When you are done with your changes, be sure to press "
#| "the <guibutton>Update</guibutton> button before exiting the dialog. Your "
#| "changes are not saved by default."
msgid ""
"If you do feel up to the challenge, here's how it works. The quote sources "
"are contained in the settings dialog. Choose the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kmymoney;</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item. From there, choose the <guilabel>Online "
"Quotes</guilabel> section. You can choose an existing source to edit, or "
"create a new one. When you are done with your changes, be sure to press the "
"<guibutton>Update</guibutton> button before exiting the dialog. Your changes "
"are not saved by default."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko midlite da ste dorasli izazovu, ovako to funkcioniše. Izvori navoda "
"su sadržani u dijalogu postavki. Odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kappname;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. "
"Zatim odaberite <guilabel>Dionice na mreži</guilabel> sekciju. Možete "
"odabrati postojeći izvor za editovanje ili napraviti novi. Kada ste završili "
"sa svojim promjenama, obavezno pritisnite <guibutton>Ažuriraj</guibutton> "
"dugme prije izlaska iz dijaloga. Nije unaprijed definisano da vaše promjene "
"budu sačuvane."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:686
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The first thing to worry about in an online quote source is the URL. This "
#| "is the page that is fetched from the web. You will see a %1 in all "
#| "sources, and a %2 in currency sources. For investments, %1 is replaced by "
#| "the trading symbol. For currencies, %1 is replaced by the From currency, "
#| "and %2 is replaced by the To currency. This URL is then fetched, all HTML "
#| "tags are removed, and that stripped file is then sent to the page parser."
msgid ""
"The first thing to consider in an online quote source is the URL. This is "
"the page that is fetched from the web. You will see a %1 in all sources, and "
"a %2 in currency sources. For investments, %1 is replaced by the trading "
"symbol. For currencies, %1 is replaced by the From currency, and %2 is "
"replaced by the To currency. This URL is then fetched, all HTML tags are "
"(optionally) removed, and that stripped file is then sent to the page parser."
msgstr ""
"Prva stvar oko koje treba brinuti u izvoru online navoda je URL. Ovo je "
"stranica koja se dobavlja sa interneta. Vidjećete %1 u svim izvorima i %2 u "
"izvorima valuta. Za investicije, %1 je zamijenjeno sa simbolom trgovanja. Za "
"valute, %1 je zamijenjeno sa From valutom, a %2 je zamijenjeno sa To "
"valutom. Ovaj Url se zatim dobavlja, sve HTML oznake se uklanjaju i tako "
"ogoljena datoteka se šalje parseru stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:695
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Note that the URL can also be a file: URL, which the quote fetcher takes "
#| "to mean an executable script. It will pass any command-line arguments to "
#| "it that you have specified, and feed the stdout to the page parser. For "
#| "example, you might have a script called getquote.sh that contains custom "
#| "quote logic, taking the symbol as a single parameter. Your URL would be "
#| "<quote>file:/path/to/getquote.sh %1</quote>."
msgid ""
"Note that the URL can also be a file: URL, which the quote fetcher takes to "
"be the path to an executable script. It will pass any command-line arguments "
"to it that you have specified, and feed the stdout to the page parser. For "
"example, you might have a script called getquote.sh that contains custom "
"quote logic, taking the symbol as a single parameter. Your URL would be "
"<quote>file:/path/to/getquote.sh %1</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da i URL može biti datoteka: URL, koji dobavljač navoda shvata "
"kao izvršnu skriptu. Proslijediće sve argumente komandne linije koje vi "
"specificirate i \"nahraniće\" stdout parsera stranice. Npr., možete imati "
"skriptu nazvanu getquote.sh koja sadrži logiku navoda, uzimajući simbol kao "
"jedini parametar. Vaš URL bi bio <quote>file:/path/to/getquote.sh %1</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:704
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The page parser looks for a symbol, a date, and a price. Regular "
#| "expressions tell it how to extract those items from the page. Please "
#| "review the documentation for the <ulink url=\"http://qt-project.org/doc/"
#| "qt-4.8/qregexp.html#1\">QRegExp class</ulink> for the exact makeup of the "
#| "regular expressions. There should be exactly one capture expression, "
#| "surrounded by parentheses, in each regexp. The date format further tells "
#| "the date parser the order of year, month, and day. This date format "
#| "should always be in the form \"%x %x %x\". where x is y, m, or d. The "
#| "date parser is very smart. <quote>%m %d %y</quote> will parse "
#| "<quote>December 31st, 2005</quote> as easily as <quote>12/31/05</quote>. "
#| "Two digit years are interpreted as being in the range of 1950-2049."
msgid ""
"The page parser looks for a symbol, a date, and a price. Regular expressions "
"tell it how to extract those items from the page. Please review the "
"documentation for the <ulink url=\"https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qregexp.html"
"\">QRegExp class</ulink> for the exact syntax regular expressions used by "
"&kmymoney;. There should be exactly one capture expression, surrounded by "
"parentheses, in each regexp field. The date format further tells the date "
"parser the order of year, month, and day. This date format should always be "
"in the form \"%x %x %x\". where x is y, m, or d. The date parser is very "
"smart. <quote>%m %d %y</quote> will parse <quote>December 31st, 2005</quote> "
"as easily as <quote>12/31/05</quote>. Two digit years are interpreted as "
"being in the range of 1950-2049."
msgstr ""
"Parser stranice traži simbol, datum i cijenu. Regularni izrazi mu govore "
"kako da ekstraktuje navedene stavke sa stranice. Molimo da pregledate "
"dokumentaciju sa <ulink url=\"http://qt-project.org/doc/qt-4.8/qregexp."
"html#1\">QRegExp class</ulink> za tačan makeup regularnih izraza. Trebao bi "
"biti tačno jedan izraz, okružen zagradama, u svakom regexp. Format datuma "
"zatim govori parseru redoslijed fodine, mjeseca i dana. Ovaj format datuma "
"bi uvijek trebao biti u formi \"%x %x %x\". gdje je x y,m ili d. Parser "
"datuma je veoma pametan. <quote>%m %d %y</quote> će lako raščlaniti "
"<quote>December 31st, 2005</quote> kao <quote>12/31/05</quote>. "
"Dvoznamenkaste godine se tumače kao godine između 1950 i 2049 godine."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:721
#, no-c-format
msgid "Unimplemented Features"
msgstr "Neprimijenjene opcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:723
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are some features that are normally associated with investments which "
"are not yet implemented in &kmymoney;. These include, but are not limited to "
"derivatives, options, and futures. In addition, when you sell a security, "
"&kmymoney; does not know which specific shares you are selling, &ie;, the "
"oldest or the most recently purchased, so it cannot calculate return on "
"investment. Finally, it has no direct knowledge about any country's specific "
"tax reporting requirements, but these can usually be handled by marking as "
"Tax related all the categories you use for transactions which might have tax "
"consequences."
msgstr ""

